msgctxt "MEDIA3/ARC/RAIN/RAIN_KAB0011.ARC/TALK_ST_KAB0011.BIN::line:19_0_3"
msgid "Yeah,{PA:10} I remember.{PA:20}||Has something happened to him?{PA:20}"
